WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:03:10,684
<b><font size="20px">Alih bahasa: @Nell.aja
https://bagibagi.co/Nell.aja</font></b>

2
00:03:10,708 --> 00:03:12,458
<i>Di mana para bajingan itu?</i>

3
00:03:12,500 --> 00:03:14,166
<i>- Bilang.</i>
- Aku tak tahu.

4
00:03:14,250 --> 00:03:15,208
<i>Bilang!</i>

5
00:04:06,125 --> 00:04:08,250
- Mau pesan apa, Nyonya?
- Dua bir.

6
00:04:40,500 --> 00:04:42,000
- Minum.
- Tak perlu, Nyonya!

7
00:04:42,375 --> 00:04:43,583
Kubilang minum.

8
00:05:12,125 --> 00:05:13,791
Berani siapa sentuh anak buahku!

9
00:05:14,791 --> 00:05:15,875
Berani kau!

10
00:07:32,791 --> 00:07:34,500
Kalau kau ragu, buat laporan.

11
00:07:34,541 --> 00:07:35,666
Baik.

12
00:07:36,041 --> 00:07:37,458
Nyonya, terima kasih banyak.

13
00:07:37,791 --> 00:07:39,113
Lihat mana perhiasanmu.

14
00:07:39,137 --> 00:07:40,458
Tunjukkan buktimu dan ambil.

15
00:07:40,500 --> 00:07:41,561
Itu.

16
00:07:41,585 --> 00:07:44,791
Bajingan itu ambil thaliku
pas aku beli susu subuh tadi.

17
00:07:44,833 --> 00:07:47,208
Kalian semua senang
dapat perhiasan kalian?

18
00:07:47,250 --> 00:07:49,042
- Hati-hati mulai sekarang.
- Makasih, Nyonya!

19
00:07:50,208 --> 00:07:51,583
- Mereka semua siapa?
- Nyonya.

20
00:07:51,625 --> 00:07:53,375
4 orang kabur dari penjara Salem.

21
00:07:53,541 --> 00:07:55,000
Kami periksa mereka berdasarkan kecurigaan.

22
00:08:01,416 --> 00:08:02,500
Berdiri!

23
00:08:05,750 --> 00:08:08,208
- Kurung 4 ini dan lepaskan yang lain.
- Baik, Nyonya.

24
00:08:08,250 --> 00:08:10,333
Hanya yang pernah dipenjara tahu perintah ini.

25
00:08:11,958 --> 00:08:13,375
Ayo!

26
00:08:15,166 --> 00:08:17,458
Ya? Nyonya sudah datang.
Aku akan beri tahu.

27
00:08:17,791 --> 00:08:20,666
- Siapa itu?
- Pemilik pabrik Saraswathy bunuh diri.

28
00:08:25,875 --> 00:08:27,916
Kenapa kau lakukan ini pada dirimu?

29
00:08:28,583 --> 00:08:31,541
Bagaimana kau tega tinggalkan aku sendiri begini?

30
00:08:34,583 --> 00:08:35,666
Sayangku!

31
00:08:38,250 --> 00:08:40,375
Kenapa kau tinggalkan aku sendiri?

32
00:08:45,375 --> 00:08:47,833
Kenapa kau lakukan ini?

33
00:08:59,833 --> 00:09:00,958
Sayang!

34
00:09:03,708 --> 00:09:04,793
Bagaimana kau tega

35
00:09:04,817 --> 00:09:06,791
sebelum aku pulang dari pernikahan?

36
00:09:08,916 --> 00:09:10,666
Kenapa kau lakukan ini?

37
00:09:10,791 --> 00:09:11,946
Apa kurang

38
00:09:11,970 --> 00:09:13,125
dari yang kau harapkan?

39
00:09:21,833 --> 00:09:24,666
Bagaimana kau tega tinggalkan aku begini?

40
00:09:27,875 --> 00:09:30,083
Bagaimana aku jawab mereka yang tanya sekarang?

41
00:09:32,333 --> 00:09:34,333
Kenapa kau lakukan ini?

42
00:09:34,375 --> 00:09:36,583
Apa yang akan aku jawab
pada putramu sekarang?

43
00:09:37,833 --> 00:09:39,833
- Kenapa kau lakukan begini?
- Nyonya!

44
00:09:40,208 --> 00:09:42,041
Tim forensik sudah selesai.

45
00:09:42,375 --> 00:09:44,458
Dilihat dari situasinya,
sepertinya bunuh diri.

46
00:09:44,500 --> 00:09:45,833
- Begitu?
- Iya, Nyonya.

47
00:09:45,875 --> 00:09:47,250
Suruh mereka lakukan otopsi.

48
00:09:47,291 --> 00:09:48,291
Baik, Nyonya!

49
00:09:48,541 --> 00:09:49,541
Sundaraj!

50
00:09:49,583 --> 00:09:51,333
- Nyonya!
- Kita perlu buat FIR.

51
00:09:51,375 --> 00:09:52,583
Ada formalitas yang harus dilakukan.

52
00:09:52,750 --> 00:09:54,625
Suruh mereka berdua datang ke kantor.

53
00:09:54,666 --> 00:09:55,666
Baik, Nyonya.

54
00:10:02,625 --> 00:10:04,958
Nyonya, mereka bilang akan
datang pakai kendaraan sendiri.

55
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:06,000
Begitu?

56
00:10:06,166 --> 00:10:08,083
- Aku ikut kendaraan mereka.
- Baik, Nyonya.

57
00:10:08,875 --> 00:10:09,875
Kau pergi.

58
00:10:23,375 --> 00:10:26,583
Bukannya kau istri kedua Pak Palanichamy?

59
00:10:30,125 --> 00:10:32,541
Kudengar pernikahanmu tidak sah.

60
00:10:38,208 --> 00:10:40,458
Kau dan Palanichamy

61
00:10:40,625 --> 00:10:42,541
punya perselisihan soal hak properti?

62
00:10:44,250 --> 00:10:46,000
Kau bilang namamu siapa?

63
00:10:46,041 --> 00:10:47,291
Ram, Nyonya.

64
00:10:47,500 --> 00:10:49,500
Ram Ram.

65
00:10:55,083 --> 00:10:56,125
Ram.

66
00:10:57,083 --> 00:10:58,958
Kenapa kau bunuh Ayahmu?

67
00:11:02,708 --> 00:11:03,708
Kakak!

68
00:11:04,333 --> 00:11:05,875
Kenapa kau hentikan mobil begitu?

69
00:11:05,916 --> 00:11:08,250
Karena kau bicara soal bos muda!

70
00:11:08,416 --> 00:11:09,625
Ada urusan di sini.

71
00:11:09,666 --> 00:11:10,875
Kau terus nyetir.

72
00:11:13,625 --> 00:11:14,708
Sekarang...

73
00:11:14,791 --> 00:11:17,333
...bos besarmu kidal, benar kan?

74
00:11:17,375 --> 00:11:19,916
Iya, dia selalu kidal.

75
00:11:20,041 --> 00:11:21,625
Apa yang kau katakan benar.

76
00:11:21,916 --> 00:11:23,083
Saat seseorang...

77
00:11:23,125 --> 00:11:25,458
...sudah kidal sejak lahir,

78
00:11:25,583 --> 00:11:27,833
bagaimana saat meninggal

79
00:11:27,875 --> 00:11:29,875
pakai tangan kiri untuk
menembak sisi kanan?

80
00:11:29,916 --> 00:11:31,708
Yang kau katakan juga masuk akal.

81
00:11:32,500 --> 00:11:33,500
Jadi...

82
00:11:33,541 --> 00:11:34,791
bos besarmu...

83
00:11:34,833 --> 00:11:36,375
pasti dibunuh oleh bos mudamu, benar?

84
00:11:36,416 --> 00:11:38,208
Nyonya, kau membawa
kami untuk formalitas.

85
00:11:38,250 --> 00:11:39,750
Kau menuduhku membunuh?

86
00:11:39,916 --> 00:11:40,916
Kakak!

87
00:11:40,958 --> 00:11:43,416
Pembunuh harus dipanggil pembunuh, bukan?

88
00:11:43,458 --> 00:11:45,208
Itu benar.

89
00:11:46,833 --> 00:11:49,125
Aku melihatmu saat masuk rumah.

90
00:11:52,500 --> 00:11:55,333
Aku tahu saat itu juga,
ini bukan bunuh diri, ini pembunuhan.

91
00:11:55,458 --> 00:11:57,708
Kalau kau berani bicara apapun sekarang,

92
00:11:57,833 --> 00:11:59,541
akan kutembak mulutmu!

93
00:12:00,625 --> 00:12:01,625
Kakak!

94
00:12:02,041 --> 00:12:03,791
Arahkan mobil ke kantor polisi!

95
00:12:32,041 --> 00:12:33,041
Ram!

96
00:12:33,500 --> 00:12:34,708
Jangan lari.

97
00:13:58,250 --> 00:14:00,500
Selamat datang!

98
00:14:00,583 --> 00:14:02,458
Aku baru berpikir kenapa
kalian belum datang.

99
00:14:02,500 --> 00:14:04,458
Kalian datang tepat waktu.
1, 2, 3, 4, 5!

100
00:14:04,500 --> 00:14:06,208
- Ya, katakan!
- Biarkan saja!

101
00:14:06,250 --> 00:14:08,791
Apa dia melakukan pembunuhan
sampai kalian kejar dan seret ke sini?

102
00:14:09,875 --> 00:14:10,875
Tentu saja!

103
00:14:10,916 --> 00:14:11,916
Dia melakukan pembunuhan!

104
00:14:11,958 --> 00:14:14,791
Ayahnya yang meninggal.
Kau bilang dia bunuh ayah kandungnya?

105
00:14:14,833 --> 00:14:18,291
Sepertinya kau belum pernah
lihat kasus seperti ini.

106
00:14:19,250 --> 00:14:20,958
Dia telah bunuh ayah kandungnya.

107
00:14:21,833 --> 00:14:24,375
Kau tak boleh menyimpulkan begitu.
Kau harus buktikan.

108
00:14:24,416 --> 00:14:25,833
Aku bisa buktikan.

109
00:14:26,208 --> 00:14:28,041
- Di pengadilan!
- Itu tidak bisa diterima!

110
00:14:28,083 --> 00:14:29,333
Lepas dulu dia.

111
00:14:29,833 --> 00:14:31,583
Kau tahu siapa dia?
Berapa banyak uang yang kau mau?

112
00:14:31,625 --> 00:14:33,041
Apa kau akan bertindak sesukamu?

113
00:14:51,791 --> 00:14:52,833
Kakak!

114
00:14:53,125 --> 00:14:54,625
Kenapa kalian berhenti?

115
00:14:54,666 --> 00:14:56,416
Lanjutkan debat kalian.

116
00:14:58,916 --> 00:15:00,666
Kasih itu!
Keluar.

117
00:15:01,416 --> 00:15:02,708
Kubilang keluar.

118
00:15:03,458 --> 00:15:05,916
Aku sudah sabar dan kalian bicara terlalu banyak.

119
00:15:05,958 --> 00:15:10,750
Bicara soal hukum padaku,
berani bicara lagi?

120
00:15:13,333 --> 00:15:14,833
Kalian perlu dicambuk!

121
00:15:15,125 --> 00:15:17,333
Masuk!
Kubilang masuk kalian semua!

122
00:15:17,375 --> 00:15:19,541
Masuk! Kau juga!

123
00:15:20,916 --> 00:15:24,958
Tak hanya kau tuduh dia palsu,
kau berani pukul klien kami di depan kami.

124
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:27,625
Dalam sepuluh menit,
seluruh asosiasi pengacara akan datang.

125
00:15:27,666 --> 00:15:30,666
Kami akan protes di depan kantormu.
Lihat saja nanti.

126
00:15:30,708 --> 00:15:32,625
Aku sudah lihat berbagai macam bar.

127
00:15:32,666 --> 00:15:34,625
Beritahu kalau perlu.
Kami akan datang ke sana juga.

128
00:15:34,666 --> 00:15:35,875
Kami akan panggil.
Ayo.

129
00:15:35,916 --> 00:15:40,458
- Ayo, Pak. Ayo. Apa yang dia pikirkan?
- Ayo, ayo!

130
00:15:53,916 --> 00:15:55,791
Apa kata wanita inspektur itu?

131
00:15:55,958 --> 00:15:58,250
Kami sudah bicara semua hukum padanya.
Dia tak mau lepaskan dia.

132
00:15:58,291 --> 00:15:59,625
Jadi kalian tak bisa lakukan apa-apa.

133
00:15:59,666 --> 00:16:02,250
Apa yang bisa kalian lakukan, para jas hitam?

134
00:16:02,458 --> 00:16:04,041
Kalau kau coba bicara...

135
00:16:04,083 --> 00:16:05,083
Pergi!

136
00:16:10,833 --> 00:16:12,416
Halo, inspektur!

137
00:16:13,416 --> 00:16:14,791
Selamat datang, Pak MLA!

138
00:16:15,333 --> 00:16:17,833
- Silakan duduk!
- Aku tak ke sini untuk duduk.

139
00:16:18,041 --> 00:16:21,291
Semua pengacaraku sudah datang
dan jelaskan semuanya detail.

140
00:16:21,333 --> 00:16:23,041
- Lepaskan dia.
- Maaf, Pak.

141
00:16:23,250 --> 00:16:25,541
Dia sudah mengaku bahwa
dialah yang membunuh.

142
00:16:25,625 --> 00:16:27,708
- Jadi aku tak bisa lagi, Pak.
- Apa ini, Nyonya?

143
00:16:27,750 --> 00:16:29,083
Dia anak muda.

144
00:16:29,125 --> 00:16:31,375
Kalau polisi mengancamnya,
ya dia akan bilang begitu.

145
00:16:31,416 --> 00:16:33,708
Kau tak seharusnya anggap ini sebagai pernyataan.

146
00:16:33,750 --> 00:16:36,416
- Tapi FIR sudah dibuat, Pak.
- Itu hanya FIR.

147
00:16:36,458 --> 00:16:38,458
Aku bilang hapus saja.

148
00:16:40,041 --> 00:16:41,541
Itu tak bisa dilakukan, Pak.

149
00:16:44,416 --> 00:16:47,208
Setelah tahu siapa menantunya,

150
00:16:47,500 --> 00:16:49,000
kau tetap bersikeras.

151
00:16:49,333 --> 00:16:50,333
Tidak, Pak!

152
00:16:50,375 --> 00:16:52,666
Aku hanya lakukan apa yang hukum perintahkan.

153
00:16:55,750 --> 00:16:57,791
Kau bilang kau tahu hukum

154
00:16:57,833 --> 00:17:00,250
sesuai protokol, seorang MLA

155
00:17:00,500 --> 00:17:02,666
berada di atas Sekretaris Kepala Tamil Nadu.

156
00:17:02,708 --> 00:17:04,791
Aku bilang lepaskan dia.

157
00:17:04,916 --> 00:17:05,958
Pak.

158
00:17:06,750 --> 00:17:08,458
Kalau komisioner datang dan bilang,

159
00:17:08,958 --> 00:17:10,250
aku tidak akan lepaskan dia.

160
00:17:11,208 --> 00:17:12,333
Begitu?

161
00:17:13,416 --> 00:17:16,708
Kau lihat nanti apa yang terjadi.

162
00:17:16,875 --> 00:17:17,958
Selamat datang, Pak!

163
00:17:19,750 --> 00:17:21,125
Kau pikir kau sarkastik?

164
00:17:27,833 --> 00:17:29,541
Hormatmu

165
00:17:29,583 --> 00:17:31,583
sangat baik, sayang!

166
00:17:32,041 --> 00:17:34,000
Pak MLA, kau lupa teleponmu!

167
00:18:02,208 --> 00:18:03,458
Ini komisioner bicara.

168
00:18:03,500 --> 00:18:05,041
Ini Venkataramani bicara.

169
00:18:05,083 --> 00:18:06,083
Katakan, MLA!

170
00:18:06,916 --> 00:18:08,791
Apa dia sudah lepaskan menantuku?

171
00:18:08,833 --> 00:18:10,500
Dia sangat bersikeras, Nyonya.

172
00:18:10,875 --> 00:18:12,750
Dia bilang kalau komisioner yang bilang,
dia tak akan lepaskan.

173
00:18:12,791 --> 00:18:14,000
Bukankah kau komisionernya?

174
00:18:14,041 --> 00:18:15,791
Bukankah dia bekerja di bawahmu?

175
00:18:15,833 --> 00:18:17,875
Apa kau tak bisa telepon dan ancam dia?

176
00:18:18,333 --> 00:18:19,333
Baiklah!

177
00:18:21,291 --> 00:18:22,666
Aku akan urus dari sekarang.

178
00:18:53,125 --> 00:18:54,125
Selamat pagi, Nyonya!

179
00:19:02,583 --> 00:19:03,750
Halo, Nyonya!

180
00:19:04,333 --> 00:19:05,375
Makasih, Paandi.

181
00:19:05,750 --> 00:19:07,416
Komisioner bicara di dalam, Nyonya.

182
00:19:08,958 --> 00:19:12,000
Sedih kau dipindahkan, Nyonya.

183
00:19:12,375 --> 00:19:14,208
10 kali pindah dalam 8 tahun!

184
00:19:15,041 --> 00:19:16,458
Aku suka, Paandi.

185
00:19:16,625 --> 00:19:19,000
Kemanapun kau pergi,
kau akan dapat nama baik, Nyonya.

186
00:19:23,208 --> 00:19:24,208
Terima kasih, Nyonya.

187
00:19:38,625 --> 00:19:39,916
Di awal saat kau bergabung,

188
00:19:39,958 --> 00:19:42,083
setiap polisi akan bergelora.

189
00:19:42,708 --> 00:19:45,541
Bagaimanapun, mata bukan hanya untuk melihat,

190
00:19:45,625 --> 00:19:47,041
kadang harus ditutup juga.

191
00:19:47,250 --> 00:19:48,250
Semoga beruntung!

192
00:20:03,541 --> 00:20:05,875
<i>Jeeva Nagar Vyasarpadi</i>

193
00:20:07,208 --> 00:20:09,125
Bunuh dia!
Jangan biarkan dia kabur!

194
00:20:11,875 --> 00:20:13,416
Kejar dia.
Bunuh dia.

195
00:20:15,791 --> 00:20:17,166
Mau ke mana?

196
00:20:18,291 --> 00:20:19,333
Serang kakinya!

197
00:20:19,500 --> 00:20:20,750
Kau mati hari ini!

198
00:20:26,125 --> 00:20:27,416
Bunuh dia!

199
00:20:29,250 --> 00:20:31,000
Mati! Pergi ke neraka!

200
00:20:54,083 --> 00:20:55,125
Tarik dia.

201
00:21:11,541 --> 00:21:12,708
Aku sudah sampai Chennai, Ayah!

202
00:21:13,666 --> 00:21:15,333
Tidak, aku mulai tugas hari ini.

203
00:21:15,541 --> 00:21:17,750
Apa pindah tugas itu baru bagiku?

204
00:21:18,791 --> 00:21:20,208
Jangan takut, Bu.

205
00:21:20,416 --> 00:21:22,333
Sepertinya sopir sudah datang.
Aku bicara nanti.

206
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:37,041
Kenapa kantor begini bersih hari ini?

207
00:21:37,083 --> 00:21:39,333
Kalian semua juga tampak siaga.
Ada apa?

208
00:21:39,500 --> 00:21:40,500
Ya, benar!

209
00:21:40,875 --> 00:21:43,166
Kau harus mulai beri bunga ekstra.

210
00:21:43,208 --> 00:21:44,708
Inspektur baru datang.

211
00:21:47,875 --> 00:21:49,291
Sayangku!

212
00:21:49,375 --> 00:21:51,166
Kalau kau menikah denganku,

213
00:21:51,208 --> 00:21:54,041
aku bilang akan kuberikan
seluruh uang pensiunku.

214
00:21:54,083 --> 00:21:56,000
Apa kau sudah pikirkan?

215
00:21:57,208 --> 00:22:00,291
Pak, apa yang akan aku
lakukan dengan uang pensiunmu?

216
00:22:01,291 --> 00:22:03,666
Apa kau bisa memberiku anak?

217
00:22:05,708 --> 00:22:06,500
Pak!

218
00:22:06,541 --> 00:22:08,458
Kenapa kalian semua tertawa?

219
00:22:25,541 --> 00:22:26,958
Hentikan kendaraan.

220
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:28,041
Baik, Nyonya.

221
00:22:28,583 --> 00:22:31,708
Di depan kantor polisi E3 Vyasarpadi,

222
00:22:31,750 --> 00:22:33,458
jam 10:30 pagi,

223
00:22:33,500 --> 00:22:35,375
Bajanlal akan dikorbankan.

224
00:22:35,458 --> 00:22:37,166
Bukannya E3 kantor kita?

225
00:22:37,250 --> 00:22:39,333
Iya, hal ini sering terjadi.

226
00:22:39,375 --> 00:22:41,958
Sebulan lalu, inspektur kantor kita dibunuh.

227
00:22:42,000 --> 00:22:43,500
Jenazahnya belum ditemukan.

228
00:22:43,875 --> 00:22:45,625
- Cepat bergerak.
- Baik, Nyonya.

229
00:22:54,916 --> 00:22:56,125
Bawa lebih cepat.

230
00:23:05,875 --> 00:23:07,291
Bunuh dia!

231
00:23:24,875 --> 00:23:26,916
<i>Jeeva Nagar Vyasarpadi</i>

232
00:23:39,125 --> 00:23:40,166
Bunuh dia!

233
00:23:45,291 --> 00:23:47,333
Berhenti!

234
00:23:53,000 --> 00:23:54,000
Lihat sini!

235
00:23:56,791 --> 00:23:58,125
Kubilang berhenti!

