818
01:08:05,541 --> 01:08:07,541
Jika nyawaku dalam bahaya,

819
01:08:07,583 --> 01:08:08,833
aku tak khawatir.

820
01:08:08,875 --> 01:08:11,125
Karena aku tak takut mati.

821
01:08:26,500 --> 01:08:28,347
Minggir! Geser.

822
01:08:28,371 --> 01:08:29,333
Geser!

823
01:08:29,375 --> 01:08:31,083
Minggir.

824
01:08:31,125 --> 01:08:35,000
Minggir.
Nanti saja urusanmu.

825
01:08:35,041 --> 01:08:37,376
Aku bilang minggir.

826
01:08:37,400 --> 01:08:39,083
Minggir!

827
