936
01:21:07,125 --> 01:21:08,125
Lihat sini!

937
01:21:08,500 --> 01:21:09,772
Tak ada yang bertanya pada telur

938
01:21:09,796 --> 01:21:11,541
sebelum membuat telur dadar!

939
01:21:12,291 --> 01:21:14,035
Aku akan kembali dengan segar,

940
01:21:14,059 --> 01:21:14,958
bersiaplah!

941
01:21:15,333 --> 01:21:16,625
Kau montok!

942
01:21:16,666 --> 01:21:18,208
Tidak, Pak!

943
01:21:25,750 --> 01:21:27,541
Apa ada orang!

944
01:21:27,583 --> 01:21:28,958
Tolong aku!

945
01:21:42,791 --> 01:21:44,125
Katakan, Vasanthi!

946
01:21:44,208 --> 01:21:45,805
Tolong selamatkan aku, Kak!

947
01:21:45,829 --> 01:21:47,916
Jawahar Babu menculikku.

948
01:21:49,000 --> 01:21:50,541
Tolong selamatkan aku, Kak!

949
01:21:50,583 --> 01:21:52,321
Jangan cemas.

950
01:21:52,345 --> 01:21:55,250
Katakan dengan jelas di mana kau!

951
01:21:55,291 --> 01:21:56,875
Aku di rumah menteri.

952
01:21:56,916 --> 01:21:57,886
