01:38:09,500 --> 01:38:11,958
ketika tidak ada bukti atau saksi,

1187
01:38:12,000 --> 01:38:13,458
aku meninjaunya dengan saksama.

1188
01:38:13,541 --> 01:38:14,916
Tapi, Yogeshwari...

1189
01:38:14,958 --> 01:38:17,208
telah membuang waktu dan
sumber daya pengadilan ini.

1190
01:38:18,375 --> 01:38:20,662
Karena itu, aku menyimpulkan bahwa tuduhan

1191
01:38:20,686 --> 01:38:21,769
terhadap Jawahar Babu

1192
01:38:21,793 --> 01:38:24,875
adalah palsu dan memberhentikan kasus ini.

1193
01:38:26,458 --> 01:38:27,666
Terima kasih, Yang Mulia.

1194
01:38:45,375 --> 01:38:46,916
Kerja bagus, pimpinan!

1195
01:39:17,791 --> 01:39:18,666
Katakan, Kak!

1196
01:39:18,708 --> 01:39:20,625
Kau akan dikepung.

1197
01:39:20,666 --> 01:39:21,708
Maksudmu?

1198
01:39:21,750 --> 01:39:23,958
Tinggalkan tempat itu segera.

1199
01:39:24,000 --> 01:39:25,250
Secepat mungkin.

1200
01:39:25,291 --> 01:39:26,750
Aku bicara nanti.

1201
01:39:26,791 --> 01:39:27,958
Baik, Kak!

1202
01:39:50,708 --> 01:39:51,958
Kita berhasil.

1203
01:39:55,000 --> 01:39:56,500
Katakan, Bu!

1204
01:39:56,791 --> 01:39:57,791
Jawahar!

1205
01:39:58,208 --> 01:39:59,666
Karena aku bilang padanya,

1206
01:39:59,833 --> 01:40:01,375
hakim telah menyelamatkanmu sekarang.

1207
01:40:01,916 --> 01:40:03,250
Tapi nilainya

1208
01:40:03,416 --> 01:40:04,708
hanya sepuluh menit.

1209
01:40:04,875 --> 01:40:06,208
Audio yang dihapus,

1210
01:40:06,458 --> 01:40:07,875
dia entah bagaimana akan
mengembalikannya.

1211
01:40:08,083 --> 01:40:09,708
Kita tak boleh beri dia waktu itu.

1212
01:40:09,875 --> 01:40:11,291
Kirim anak buahmu segera.

1213
01:40:11,375 --> 01:40:13,416
- Aku juga akan cari.
- Baik, Bu!

1214
01:40:15,208 --> 01:40:16,875
- Cari dia.
- Baik, Kak!

1215
01:40:22,000 --> 01:40:23,333
Ini komisaris bicara.

1216
01:40:23,958 --> 01:40:26,833
TN 10 DC 2223.

1217
01:40:27,541 --> 01:40:29,000
Peluru sedang bergerak.

1218
01:40:29,250 --> 01:40:30,666
Di area mana?

1219
01:40:30,791 --> 01:40:32,250
- Periksa dan katakan.
- Ya, Bu.

1220
01:40:47,625 --> 01:40:49,250
- Apa yang terjadi, sob?
- Kak!

1221
01:40:50,041 --> 01:40:51,916
Inspektur itu tidak ada di rumahnya.

1222
01:40:51,958 --> 01:40:53,041
Apa kau cari dengan baik?

1223
01:40:53,083 --> 01:40:55,208
Rumahnya terkunci dan tidak ada orang.

1224
01:40:55,250 --> 01:40:56,250
Cari di tempat lain.

1225
01:40:56,291 --> 01:40:57,791
Baik, pasti, Kak!

1226
01:41:07,125 --> 01:41:08,449
Peluru itu sedang menuju

1227
01:41:08,473 --> 01:41:09,583
ke arah hutan Tada.

1228
01:41:12,291 --> 01:41:13,291
Oke.

1229
01:41:21,583 --> 01:41:23,125
- Katakan, Bu!
- Jawahar.

1230
01:41:23,458 --> 01:41:24,655
Pelurunya sedang menuju

1231
01:41:24,679 --> 01:41:25,875
ke area hutan Tada.

1232
01:41:26,041 --> 01:41:28,250
- Bicara dengan Chittoor Rao segera.
- Bu!

1233
01:41:28,291 --> 01:41:29,791
Dia takkan bisa kabur sekarang.

1234
01:42:23,125 --> 01:42:24,458
Kau ke sana.

1235
01:42:24,916 --> 01:42:26,000
Kau masuk ke hutan.

1236
01:42:26,041 --> 01:42:27,375
Kalian ikut aku.

1237
01:42:53,125 --> 01:42:54,541
Kak, motornya di sini.

1238
01:42:54,583 --> 01:42:55,583
Masuk.

1239
01:42:57,416 --> 01:42:59,333
Di mana pun dia,
potong saja kepalanya!

1240
01:42:59,791 --> 01:43:01,833
Aku akan bungkus dan kirim padamu.

1241
01:43:23,125 --> 01:43:26,291
Jangan lari.
Tangkap dia.

1242
01:43:27,708 --> 01:43:29,166
Tangkap dia.

1243
01:43:30,583 --> 01:43:32,166
Jangan biarkan dia kabur!

1244
01:43:37,666 --> 01:43:39,125
Tangkap dia cepat!

1245
01:43:58,291 --> 01:43:59,708
Tangkap dari sana.

1246
01:44:00,625 --> 01:44:01,625
Bunuh dia!

1247
01:44:13,583 --> 01:44:15,541
Kepung dia!

1248
01:44:43,875 --> 01:44:45,041
Awas!

1249
01:44:45,416 --> 01:44:46,625
Dia jatuh.

1250
01:45:03,416 --> 01:45:04,458
Kak!

1251
01:45:04,541 --> 01:45:06,125
Apa kau potong kepalanya?

1252
01:45:06,541 --> 01:45:07,708
Dia mati, Kak!

1253
01:45:07,791 --> 01:45:09,458
Apa katamu?

1254
01:45:09,750 --> 01:45:11,125
Aku mau menebasnya.

1255
01:45:11,333 --> 01:45:12,625
Tapi dia tersandung akar,

1256
01:45:12,791 --> 01:45:14,833
jatuh dan mati!

1257
01:45:15,916 --> 01:45:17,500
Dia mati, kan?

1258
01:45:17,541 --> 01:45:19,708
Kak, di sini ada macan tutul,

1259
01:45:19,750 --> 01:45:21,715
singa, dan harimau tinggal

1260
01:45:21,739 --> 01:45:23,375
di tempat menakutkan ini.

1261
01:45:23,416 --> 01:45:25,250
Kirim kepalanya padaku.

1262
01:45:25,750 --> 01:45:27,509
Mereka akan mencium darahnya,

1263
01:45:27,533 --> 01:45:29,291
dan memakannya tanpa jejak.

1264
01:45:29,333 --> 01:45:31,208
Wanita ini mati.

1265
01:45:31,291 --> 01:45:33,500
Kau tenang, Kak!

1266
01:45:36,375 --> 01:45:37,583
Ayo pergi.

1267
01:45:42,750 --> 01:45:43,708
Pak!

1268
01:45:43,750 --> 01:45:46,000
Sudah 15 hari putri kami hilang.

1269
01:45:46,041 --> 01:45:48,125
Jika seseorang hilang,
apa kau akan diam saja, Pak?

1270
01:45:48,583 --> 01:45:49,759
Kami sudah mengajukan pengaduan

1271
01:45:49,783 --> 01:45:50,958
di kantor komisaris juga.

1272
01:45:51,000 --> 01:45:52,456
Kami sudah mengajukan
kasus habeas corpus

1273
01:45:52,480 --> 01:45:53,375
di pengadilan juga.

1274
01:45:53,416 --> 01:45:55,083
Tetap tidak ada yang terjadi, Pak.

1275
01:45:55,125 --> 01:45:56,458
Siapa orang-orang ini?

1276
01:45:56,791 --> 01:45:58,708
Mereka orang tua Yogeshwari.

1277
01:45:58,791 --> 01:46:01,083
Kau ambil berkas Jawahar Babu.

1278
01:46:01,500 --> 01:46:03,000
- Halo, Bu.
- Halo, Pak.

1279
01:46:03,041 --> 01:46:04,083
Aku juga dengar.

1280
01:46:04,125 --> 01:46:05,541
Aku merasa sangat sedih.

1281
01:46:05,708 --> 01:46:07,625
Bagaimanapun, dia rekanku.

1282
01:46:07,875 --> 01:46:09,541
Kau jangan khawatir.

1283
01:46:09,625 --> 01:46:10,914
Tidak akan terjadi apa-apa padanya.

1284
01:46:10,938 --> 01:46:12,083
Aku juga melakukan yang terbaik.

1285
01:46:12,166 --> 01:46:13,416
Berikan.

1286
01:46:13,750 --> 01:46:14,875
Aku pamit dulu.

1287
01:46:16,791 --> 01:46:17,791
Ayo pergi.

1288
01:46:23,333 --> 01:46:24,916
Yogeshwari seperti anakku.

1289
01:46:26,083 --> 01:46:29,083
Jika aku mendapat informasi kecil tentangnya,

1290
01:46:29,416 --> 01:46:30,833
aku akan beri tahu.

1291
01:46:32,041 --> 01:46:33,041
Jaga diri.

1292
01:46:35,333 --> 01:46:37,041
Hebat!

1293
01:46:46,541 --> 01:46:48,375
Kau hebat, Kak!

1294
01:46:48,708 --> 01:46:50,333
Kau lihat seranganku?

1295
01:46:53,791 --> 01:46:54,833
Halo, Kak!

1296
01:46:55,541 --> 01:46:58,000
Atas rekomendasimu aku ditempatkan di sini.

1297
01:46:58,125 --> 01:46:59,416
Kau lakukan apa pun yang kau mau,

1298
01:46:59,541 --> 01:47:00,750
aku akan bersamamu.

1299
01:47:00,916 --> 01:47:03,333
Vyasarpadi ini selalu bentengmu, Kak!

1300
01:47:05,166 --> 01:47:06,333
Ini dia.

1301
01:47:07,291 --> 01:47:08,333
Berikan.

1302
01:47:19,875 --> 01:47:21,666
Yogi!

1303
01:47:25,583 --> 01:47:26,875
Tuangkan.

1304
01:47:27,250 --> 01:47:29,958
Semua kasusku sekarang ditutup!

1305
01:47:35,125 --> 01:47:37,416
Ceritanya juga ditutup!

1306
01:47:44,125 --> 01:47:46,625
- Kak, sampai jumpa!
- Baik, sampai jumpa!

1307
01:48:03,958 --> 01:48:05,416
Kak, kau tunggu di sini.

1308
01:48:05,833 --> 01:48:07,083
Aku akan lihat.

1309
01:48:07,125 --> 01:48:08,458
Lihatlah.

1310
01:48:09,708 --> 01:48:11,041
Kau ke sana.

1311
01:51:15,416 --> 01:51:17,083
Bagaimana kau bisa kabur?

1312
01:51:42,500 --> 01:51:43,666
Ayo!

1313
01:53:35,125 --> 01:53:38,125
Kematianmu ada di tanganku!

1314
01:53:40,125 --> 01:53:41,416
Sekarang, hidupmu,

1315
01:53:41,458 --> 01:53:43,125
ada di kakiku!

1316
01:53:43,291 --> 01:53:45,666
Berapa banyak nyawa yang
telah kau hancurkan?

1317
01:53:45,750 --> 01:53:47,333
Kau tak layak hidup.

1318
01:53:47,375 --> 01:53:49,416
Hak menghukum orang jahat

1319
01:53:49,458 --> 01:53:52,292
hanya diberikan kepada polisi setelah Tuhan!

1320
01:54:31,416 --> 01:54:32,416
<i>Selamat malam!</i>

1321
01:54:32,458 --> 01:54:35,506
<i>Pengusaha yang beralih jadi
politisi dari Chennai Utara,</i>

1322
01:54:35,530 --> 01:54:36,703
<i>Bapak Jawahar Babu,</i>

1323
01:54:36,727 --> 01:54:38,458
<i>akibat overdosis narkoba,</i>

1324
01:54:38,500 --> 01:54:40,750
<i>meninggal setelah dalam keadaan koma.</i>

1325
01:54:40,791 --> 01:54:43,383
<i>Komisaris Shyamala IPS</i>

1326
01:54:43,407 --> 01:54:45,583
<i>yang merupakan kaki tangannya</i>

1327
01:54:45,916 --> 01:54:47,416
<i>telah diskors dari jabatannya,</i>

1328
01:54:47,458 --> 01:54:48,833
<i>dan dipindahkan ke Angkatan Bersenjata.</i>

1329
01:54:48,875 --> 01:54:52,175
<i>Bertindak cepat dan menangkap
semua anak buah Jawahar Babu,</i>

1330
01:54:52,199 --> 01:54:53,969
<i>dan asetnya dengan menyerahkannya</i>

1331
01:54:53,993 --> 01:54:55,000
<i>ke pengadilan.</i>

1332
01:54:55,041 --> 01:54:56,953
<i>Petugas Yogeshwari telah dipromosikan</i>

1333
01:54:56,977 --> 01:54:59,583
<i>sebagai Asisten Komisaris Polisi Chennai.</i>

1334
01:55:19,791 --> 01:55:21,555
Selamat datang dan terima kasih.

1335
01:55:21,579 --> 01:55:23,666
Kenapa semua formalitas ini?

1336
01:55:23,708 --> 01:55:25,500
- Terima kasih!
- Selamat, Bu!

1337
01:55:25,583 --> 01:55:27,833
Terima kasih.
Apa kabar kalian semua, Kak?

1338
01:55:27,875 --> 01:55:29,166
- Selamat, Bu.
- Kami semua baik, Bu!

1339
01:55:29,208 --> 01:55:32,041
- Terima kasih. Bagaimana kantornya?
- Semuanya baik, Bu!

1340
01:55:32,083 --> 01:55:33,541
Pasti baik tanpa aku.

1341
01:55:33,583 --> 01:55:34,833
Pasti tidak, Bu!

1342
01:55:34,875 --> 01:55:36,791
Boleh kami peluk sekali?

1343
01:55:36,833 --> 01:55:38,500
Tentu, ayo.

1344
01:55:40,125 --> 01:55:41,041
Senang?

1345
01:55:41,125 --> 01:55:43,269
- Boleh foto bareng?
- Tentu saja.

1346
01:55:43,293 --> 01:55:44,000
Ayo!

1347
01:55:46,333 --> 01:55:47,333
Siap, Bu?

1348
01:55:47,833 --> 01:55:49,250
Sebentar!

1349
01:55:54,416 --> 01:55:55,500
Sekarang aku siap!